config RTL8192F_SOC
	tristate "Realtek RTL8192F-SoC (RTL8197F integrated) wireless support"
	depends on MAC80211
	depends on MIPS || COMPILE_TEST
	help
	  This adds support for the 802.11bgn 1T1R WiFi core integrated in
	  the Realtek RTL8197F router SoC.  The core is a member of the
	  RTL8192F (gen-2.5) family wired directly to the SoC bus with a
	  PCI-style descriptor DMA engine.

	  If you choose to build it as a module, it will be called
	  rtl8192f_soc.
